# Support

Where to go, by question type. Please use the right channel — it is the fastest route to an answer.

| I want to... | Go to |
|---|---|
| Ask how something works | [Discussions](https://github.com/{{OWNER}}/{{PROJECT_NAME}}/discussions) |
| Report a bug | [Bug report form](https://github.com/{{OWNER}}/{{PROJECT_NAME}}/issues/new?template=bug_report.yml) |
| Request a feature | [Feature request form](https://github.com/{{OWNER}}/{{PROJECT_NAME}}/issues/new?template=feature_request.yml) |
| Propose a change to the PRD, TRD or an ADR | [Spec change form](https://github.com/{{OWNER}}/{{PROJECT_NAME}}/issues/new?template=spec_change.yml) |
| Report a security vulnerability | [SECURITY.md](SECURITY.md) — never a public issue |
| Contribute code | [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md) |

Before opening an issue, please check the [documentation map](docs/index.md) and search existing
issues and discussions.

This project is maintained on a best-effort basis. There is no service level agreement on responses
to support questions.
